esc:`Switch the audio output used by the current player. Electron desktop is the primary target, and browser environments also work when setSinkId is available.`,audioOutputRefresh:`Refresh`,audioOutputUnsupported:`This environment does not support switching audio output devices.`,audioOutputLoadFailed:`Failed to load audio output devices.`,audioOutputSelectFailed:`Failed to switch the audio output device.`,audioOutputUnnamed:`Output Device`,audioOutputDefault:`System Default`,audioOutputDefaultDesc:`Follow the operating system's current default output device.`,audioOutputLoading:`Loading output devices...`,audioOutputSelecting:`Switching output device...`,audioOutputEmpty:`No switchable output devices were detected.`,saveCustomTheme:`Save Custom Theme`,saveAndApplyCustomTheme:`Save and Apply Custom Theme`,preferCustomTheme:`Prefer Custom Theme`,preferCustomThemeDesc:`When enabled, song theme auto switching will be turned off.`,autoSwitchSongTheme:`Auto Switch Theme`,autoSwitchSongThemeDesc:`Automatically apply cached AI themes. This is mutually exclusive with preferring custom themes.`,autoGenerateSongTheme:`Auto-generate themes for playing songs`,themeGenerationSource:`Theme Generation Source`,themeGenerationSourceAi:`AI Inference`,themeGenerationSourceCover:`Cover Colors`,themeGenerationSourceAiDesc:`Reads the lyrics with an AI model and infers a mood palette. Needs an API key and consumes tokens.`,themeGenerationSourceAiUnavailable:`No API key is configured for the selected AI provider, so AI inference is disabled.`,configureAiApiKey:`Open AI theme settings`,themeGenerationSourceCoverDesc:`Builds the palette straight from the cover colors. No API key needed, but the result is less expressive and carries fewer attributes.`,autoGenerateSongThemeCoverDesc:`When a playing song has no cached theme, generate one from its cover and apply it.`,autoGenerateSongThemeDesc:`When a playing song has no cached AI theme, generate and apply one automatically.`,updatePreferredCus